## 6. Automated Fastlane `supply` Deployment Pipeline

To eliminate manual binary uploads in the Google Play Console, Bitrise pipelines execute automated deployment using Fastlane:

```ruby
# fastlane/Fastfile
lane :deploy_google_play do
  upload_to_play_store(
    package_name: 'com.enterprise.mobileapp',
    track: 'production',
    rollout: '0.05', # Initial 5% staged rollout
    aab: './android/app/build/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab',
    json_key: ENV['GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON'],
    skip_upload_metadata: false,
    skip_upload_images: false,
    skip_upload_screenshots: false
  )
end
```
